{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;to the&quot;</strong> is <strong>a single-path philosophical adventure</strong>. where <strong>no two players share the same experience</strong> \u2014 a bold, challenging work that <strong>questions modern society</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>a philosophical walking simulator</strong> that tests your <strong>memory</strong> and <strong>luck \u00d7</strong> <strong>strategy</strong>. Keep moving forward \u2014 your goal is to reach <strong>10,000 meters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove your memory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way you will be faced with a variety of binary choices. Remember the \u201ccorrect\u201d choices you encounter; selecting them again later will lengthen the path. Fail to choose correctly and the path shortens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crucially, what counts as a \u201ccorrect\u201d choice differs from player to player</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 other people\u2019s answers won\u2019t help. What you need is your own memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outstrategize Luck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll often find yourself facing philosophical dilemmas \u2014 \u201cIs love more important than money?\u201d \u2014 questions with no single correct answer. At times you can <strong>opt for \u2018Luck\u2019</strong> instead of choosing directly. Outcomes are partly governed by chance, but your strategic choices change the odds and the difficulty of those outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089540/extras/2d3a3faf8fad22658f576fb8a1d7cd08.avif?t=1762605097\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love or money \u2014 which will you choose?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail to extend the path and reach its \u201cterminus\u201d before 10,000 m, it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finally reach 10,000 m, <strong><u>you will learn a truth that overturns everything</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2014 <strong>and realize that the game itself <i>was</i> philosophy.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stood on a strange, single road whose length kept changing. With not a scrap of memory, you begin an endless forward march. Exposed to a deluge of knowledge, beasts rush ahead in pursuit of their ideals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cEnd your restless days \u2014 question the way you live.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60\u2013240 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depends on your effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls (Keyboard &amp; Mouse)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD \u2013 Move (Press twice to run), Select</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse \u2013 Look around</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space \u2013 Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click \u2013 Examine / Progress dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc \u2013 Settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls (Gamepad)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick \u2013 Move / Look around / Select</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A / Button 3 \u2013 Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X / Button 1 \u2013 Examine / Progress dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >START / Button 12 \u2013 Settings</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"2000m","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089540/b124a929a6d197dbc79a87dfda009e7de759f11e.jpg"},{"name":"4000m","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089540/7aac108761196b7bbccc52f38efd68ccae0063dc.jpg"},{"name":"6000m","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089540/99ef3c39b051eaf080018e33b60e08f669c71bb7.jpg"},{"name":"8000m","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089540/9a4b841720a8c696bede2ac8f1d2c1485496839c.jpg"},{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089540/2c9aab5573dc59464d73846ed06667479d28573b.jpg"},{"name":"True End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4089540/58a818cf3dd06b18cd7827650fba87ba25653e2d.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089540?t=1762605097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089540/dc9759e3181a931169cf39d311598266e859944e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762605097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089540/4216f727fa7c654defcc2a76f32d98188c82fb21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762605097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089540/4216f727fa7c654defcc2a76f32d98188c82fb21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762605097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;to the&quot;</strong> is <strong>a 